t i'm doing favorite broadway  show to watch as a fan and why  i would have to say it would be hamilton  and um  once again what i love about it is it  puts  people of color inside of real human  characters telling  real human stories with  three-dimensional human beings  i love that and i also love you know the  effect that what i call the hamilton  effect which is  uh speaking to this idea of immigration  and that  america is built on the spirit of  immigration we are all  immigrants except the indigenous people  of america who this country was stolen  from  that's why i like watching hamilton  thank you everybody for spending some  time with me  and please tune in to equal on hbo max  when it comes out in october god bless  [Music]  you  you
 

